{"html":"<h1 id=\"core-language-benchmark\">Core language benchmark</h1>\n<p>10 compile runs, 10 fresh-process runs, and 100 raw runtime runs. Values shown as mean ± sample standard deviation in ms. Compile warmups: 1. Process warmups: 1. Raw runtime warmups: 3.</p>\n<p>Matched rows keep the same algorithm. Idiomatic rows allow each ecosystem's normal optimized implementation; inspect the linked source before comparing them.</p>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-incremental-per-function-policy-landscape\">VKF incremental per-function policy landscape</h2>\n<p>This one-time search is separate from cached compilation. Adaptive masks select lowering only; parallel execution remains a separate proof-gated decision.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">searched</th><th scope=\"col\">reused</th><th scope=\"col\">masks</th><th scope=\"col\">rejected → baseline</th><th scope=\"col\">wall (ms)</th><th scope=\"col\">function policy</th><th scope=\"col\">module ABI</th><th scope=\"col\">function winners</th><th scope=\"col\">parallel eligible / selected</th><th scope=\"col\">threads created / joined / closed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>2560</td><td>0</td><td>101077.556</td><td>mixed</td><td>mask-0</td><td>$entry: mask-0; advance: mask-0; fannkuch: mask-0; multiply_at_av: mask-0; multiply_atv: mask-fc; multiply_av: mask-fc; n_body: mask-fc; offset_momentum: mask-0; spectral_norm: mask-0; system_energy: mask-0</td><td>false / false</td><td>0 / 0 / 0</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"compile-time-ms\">Compile time (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23503.213 ± 30.983</td><td>484.917 ± 5.142</td><td>145.504 ± 0.902</td><td>242.500 ± 5.993</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-ms\">Runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>16.715 ± 0.219</td><td>40.049 ± 0.350</td><td>36.012 ± 0.360</td><td>37.506 ± 0.114</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-internal-compiler-core-time-including-optimizer-ms\">VKF internal compiler-core time, including optimizer (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23496.650 ± 31.124</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-empirical-optimizer-time-within-compilation-ms\">VKF empirical optimizer time within compilation (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>24.892 ± 0.157</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"raw-kernel-runtime-ms\">Raw kernel runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>14.391 ± 0.181</td><td>36.938 ± 0.778</td><td>33.616 ± 0.237</td><td>35.344 ± 0.170</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-raw-kernel-runtime-ratio\">VKF raw-kernel runtime ratio</h2>\n<p>VKF time divided by the peer time on the same pinned CPU; below 1× means VKF is faster.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / C++</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm + fannkuch-redux + n-body checksum</td><td>0.390×</td><td>0.428×</td><td>0.407×</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Core language benchmark","id":"core-language-benchmark"},{"level":2,"title":"VKF incremental per-function policy landscape","id":"vkf-incremental-per-function-policy-landscape"},{"level":2,"title":"Compile time (ms)","id":"compile-time-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"Runtime (ms)","id":"runtime-ms"},